<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Every day, farmers need to apply different techniques in the field. They add fertilizers to the soil and fix machines when something is not working well. During the planting season, they sow seeds and later cultivate the crops with care. When the plants grow too much, they trim branches and remove damaged parts. Before harvesting, farmers often treat the plants to protect them from diseases. In some cases, they lime the soil to improve fertility. After that, they label containers and repeat the process in other fields. These actions are part of daily farm management and help improve productivity and crop quality.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
